<ontology/use_pharmaceuticals/use_pharmaceuticals__doc_cardamom__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section CARDAMOMS" ;
